stamp="2495">41:35</a>-马</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a>-羊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2618">43:38</a>-猴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2696">44:56</a>-鸡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2953">49:13</a>-狗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3051">50:51</a>-猪</span></p><span></span><p><span>【听友群指路】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgYnykrBvC8opdbV_7aQ97U6UFvk.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>小观指路也可进入听友群与两位师兄交流更多哦～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtSSSOx1HoM-DA3HHI9ozGfQdFPN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>坂本龍一 - Merry Christmas Mr. Lawrence</span></p><span></span><p><span>麦振鸿 - 猜灯谜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期制作】小罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【海报设计】大罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【商务合作】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:971785860@qq.com"><span>971785860@qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
