    <guid isPermaLink="false">6728d24ccbe0e69c8b153381</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Nov 2024 14:05:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgmkL_Lhv533zg2PknLWMswjdxDb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【节目简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>道之为物，惟恍惟惚。9月初，二狗师兄一行前往江西龙虎山拜访学习。路漫漫其修远兮，吾将上下而求索。</span></p><span></span><p><span>趁此机会，本期二狗师兄将分享一期有关道家弟子的修行之路（正一派和全真派）受禄拔职流程以及不同地区的道教唱韵特色～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目常驻】</span></p><span></span><p><span>崟天老师（二狗师兄）</span></p><span></span><p><span>二狗是全真第二十二代弟子，从小跟着外公师父先生学习阴阳术。十年里面学习了六爻三元天星风水，和道教的祝由十三科</span></p><span></span><p><span>三儀师兄</span></p><span></span><p><span>江西龍虎山道教正一派三字派傳度小道道號三儀。陰陽宅風水（三元派、三合派、八宅、過路陰陽、九宮飛星），大六壬預測，命理八字，面相，法事祈福開運。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚毕业设计研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span>小罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚毕业设计研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>暂无</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a>-杭州的寺庙游历经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a>-道教的等级划分原来有这么多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a>-道家弟子的受禄流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a>-原来，成为一名道家弟子的时间远不止30年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a>-各地不同的唱经韵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1382">23:02</a>-八大神咒分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入听友群交流分享～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkp9PxtvGNbPPHMlUFOAaNWT8IBv.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【八大神咒】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsY-Zm6ORTBe7lnRG1CbmsrJ_xtM.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgFpvNlTtVSp7ORunmWm5RJCp5aP.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjEzEsyTJWRlb2VlwlQICfkhC_-.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr7LddwANBzkq5g5oK5GiEs-aPdY.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqwi0AeZcfo5Rdd9S6aeLEVwzWrb.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuDGXxZyoT6vxQKivTWh9cEC4Fry.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgfV7YlIMIaUKeHBs6JtHZ2vbtm9.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhBa5JP8lXy4tdbcZZHo-_8CCxM-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cochemea - Burning Plain</span></p><span></span><p><span>麦振鸿 - 猜灯谜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期制作】小罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文案编辑】大罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【商务合作】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:971785860@qq.com"><span>971785860@qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
