    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Sep 2024 14:53:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgmkL_Lhv533zg2PknLWMswjdxDb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【节目简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>二狗师兄带着他的图来啦！超干超干的干货，大家听音频的时候可以和下面的配图一一对应，一起从0开始学习八宅布局！片尾还有福利小彩蛋（在评论区留下户型图，二狗师兄会随机抽取5位帮忙看大致的吉凶位布局哦～）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目常驻】</span></p><span></span><p><span>崟天老师（二狗师兄）</span></p><span></span><p><span>二狗是全真第二十二代弟子，从小跟着外公师父先生学习阴阳术。十年里面学习了六爻三元天星风水，和道教的祝由十三科</span></p><span></span><p><span>三儀师兄</span></p><span></span><p><span>江西龍虎山道教正一派三字派傳度小道道號三儀。陰陽宅風水（三元派、三合派、八宅、過路陰陽、九宮飛星），大六壬預測，命理八字，面相，法事祈福開運。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚毕业设计研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span>小罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚毕业设计研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>暂无</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a>为什么门在阳宅中很重要？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a>-有关门的民俗文化</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a>-东西四宅分别是哪些？吉位适合厨房、沙发？凶位装厕所</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a>如何看自家房子的坐向？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a>八宅配门小课堂教学</span></p><span></span><p><span>【有关门的民俗】</span></p><span></span><h1><span>关于门的民俗</span></h1><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lgrRzuFxs9Uda8A7pHU_rg" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lgrRzuFxs9Uda8A7pHU_rg">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></p><span></span><h1><span>穿越与回望一一关于门的寓意与兆示</span></h1><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DaxQjRGPi78ALjFq0Lth0g" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DaxQjRGPi78ALjFq0Lth0g">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期适合配合图片一期听哦～】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmTbyUCVxFFLjJGePLF5553Jbfxj.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure>