    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e446975ca6d0ace3c17c24</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Sep 2024 14:05:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgmkL_Lhv533zg2PknLWMswjdxDb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【节目简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>二狗师兄带着他的图来啦！超干超干的干货，大家听音频的时候可以和下面的配图一一对应，一起从0开始学习阳宅化煞！片尾还有助力销售工位布局指南哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目常驻】</span></p><span></span><p><span>崟天老师（二狗师兄）</span></p><span></span><p><span>二狗是全真第二十二代弟子，从小跟着外公师父先生学习阴阳术。十年里面学习了六爻三元天星风水，和道教的祝由十三科</span></p><span></span><p><span>三儀师兄</span></p><span></span><p><span>江西龍虎山道教正一派三字派傳度小道道號三儀。陰陽宅風水（三元派、三合派、八宅、過路陰陽、九宮飛星），大六壬預測，命理八字，面相，法事祈福開運。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚毕业设计研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span>小罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚毕业设计研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>暂无</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span>-“煞”在风水中是什么意思？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-常见【阳宅煞气】配图，形煞一一讲解</span></p><span></span><p><span>天斩煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FttM90FHbx6BFVL-k4JwB4rf3Bqm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>反弓煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvCHrEa878DxSzDyP0AeMMq11uNw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>孤阳煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs_woTUMgnsI2JbaPVk4gjohwQwA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>角冲煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJw40G4Y3Qgsk9pd0A_nnoN8ZlS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>穿心煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrA9ubcMZuKGoldqnw78_HqWC49y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>路冲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTLabssFtPHdrBo6Gx6RxpK27nO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>白虎煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmmO0yjtBmjpjRud4EquwL0iaQBC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>剪刀煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvabvWbOtgZYNdTlKOxL1z3bMAKw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>丁煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqyIrQZ-_-_V4sOs-CQkyfT5C8-c.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>长短房</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtQ1vtDOzkSCaPUGXQ3WIa-cZULD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>庙房</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpvOjMniITQX_KSlM01yAnH1622H.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>阴成形阳化气</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpBzy3lifDPmYACuorM_93DQ4U7-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>背包房</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQXiuvAoCEaj-KLEoJfqeLz38rr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>腾蛇入户</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv_aWBpoKfGMNgcxIQEjDN5dkAVl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>飞屋檐煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fthb8Qu9_OqKUDfKjFQTozWt-ynS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>蜈蚣煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgTMeu0TGfd3KezBZOxRkDVZphal.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>壁刀煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtZ9oMGBmx75T85zmnfuvCBs_FN8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>官帽煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj6RMruJhus05-BFbKGJofXUyaoi.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>无尾巷煞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjKbWyESyNDhS0ZD2yfHr7K7UGJj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家进听友群交流～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>星座书上 - 许嵩</span></p><span></span><p><span>麦振鸿 - 猜灯谜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期制作】小罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文案编辑】大罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【商务合作】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:971785860@qq.com"><span>971785860@qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
