    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d87badee04007d882ee655</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Sep 2024 15:24:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgmkL_Lhv533zg2PknLWMswjdxDb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【节目简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>上期我们聊了上香仪式以及师兄们外出学习中的敬山神文化等，那么这期，我们的选题也是继续从游戏中的丹药说起，一起聊聊道教的丹药、丹道养生二三事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目常驻】</span></p><span></span><p><span>崟天老师（二狗师兄）</span></p><span></span><p><span>二狗是全真第二十二代弟子，从小跟着外公师父先生学习阴阳术。十年里面学习了六爻三元天星风水，和道教的祝由十三科</span></p><span></span><p><span>三儀师兄</span></p><span></span><p><span>江西龍虎山道教正一派三字派傳度小道道號三儀。陰陽宅風水（三元派、三合派、八宅、過路陰陽、九宮飛星），大六壬預測，命理八字，面相，法事祈福開運。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚毕业设计研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span>小罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚毕业设计研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>暂无</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">05:37</a>-《黑神话·悟空》中的神奇丹药大揭秘！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a>-道教的内丹术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a>-二狗师兄的丹道修炼之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a>-五行养生与二十四山养生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a>-破解24年五黄三煞小方法</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家进听友群交流～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【推文链接】</span></p><span></span><h1><span>《黑神话：悟空》攻略大揭秘！神奇丹药你了解多少？</span></h1><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lBkfZI4gAZbNs8L0NuXcmg" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lBkfZI4gAZbNs8L0NuXcmg">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></p><span></span><h1><span>《黑神话悟空》葫芦一览</span></h1><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/pqpug-In6opJsLajAX-h8w" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/pqpug-In6opJsLajAX-h8w">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></p><span></span><h1><span>天命人，必备的中草药一览，黑悟空通关秘籍《黑神话：悟空》之草药篇</span></h1><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VOCEpQ6IJSPNnCgoZ_pD