  <item>
    <title>最简单有效的夏季养生——三伏天坚持泡脚</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666eb304c26e396a36229a57</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666eb304c26e396a36229a57</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Jun 2024 09:40:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgmkL_Lhv533zg2PknLWMswjdxDb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【节目简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《道德经》有云：“上善若水，水善利万物而不争。”夏日炎炎，天地之气交泰，万物负阴而抱阳，冲气以为和。人应顺应自然，调和阴阳，以平和之心，接纳天地之气，养生之道，自然而成。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们邀请潇怡老师返场，为大家继续科普一些关于夏季艾灸、拔罐、泡脚养生的分享，希望各位听众姥爷喜欢～～</span></p><span></span><p><span>听完赶快行动起来进入夏季养生吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目常驻】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>崟天老师（二狗师兄）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>二狗是全真第二十二代弟子，从小跟着外公师父先生学习阴阳术。十年里面学习了六爻三元天星风水，和道教的祝由十三科</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>三儀师兄</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>江西龍虎山道教正一派三字派傳度小道道號三儀。陰陽宅風水（三元派、三合派、八宅、過路陰陽、九宮飛星），大六壬預測，命理八字，面相，法事祈福開運。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>大罗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>刚毕业设计研究生</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小罗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>刚毕业设计研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>候潇怡老师</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>中医世家，从医15年，在景德镇有自己的中医馆！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a>-耳穴疗法是什么？适用于哪些病症？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a>-大家都适合艾灸吗？阴虚内热体质需要少艾灸？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a>-如何判断艾灸完身体呈现的一些正反馈？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a>-艾灸穴位还可以治疗情绪、睡眠？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a>-想要皮肤淡斑、透亮建议自己在家灸灸关元穴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">18:07</a>-三伏天避暑小贴士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2127">35:27</a>-一年四季泡脚小tips(春夏秋冬要注意的点可不一样！)</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>欢迎大家进听友群交流～</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fntey2Wz3-W8afVc9df6owRrC16M.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>李欣芸 - 阳光舞甜橙</span></p><span></span><p><span>Summer Salt - Speaking Sonar</span></p><span></span><p><span>麦振鸿 - 猜灯谜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期制作】小罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文案编辑】大罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【商务合作】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:971785860@qq.com"><span>971785860@qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
