    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgmkL_Lhv533zg2PknLWMswjdxDb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【节目简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>端午时节，古称"毒月"，民间流传着避五毒的习俗，这五毒指的是蛇、蝎、蜈蚣、壁虎和蟾蜍。古人认为五月天气渐热，五毒活跃，易伤人，故有避五毒之举。端午避虫除邪还能旺运吗？在饮食养生上有什么需要注意的？为什么要在大中午打一碗阳水？带着系列疑问我们录制了本期节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本期播出的同时，预祝高三考生高粽！大家端午安康～）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目常驻】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>崟天老师（二狗师兄）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>二狗是全真第二十二代弟子，从小跟着外公师父先生学习阴阳术。十年里面学习了六爻三元天星风水，和道教的祝由十三科</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>三儀师兄</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>江西龍虎山道教正一派三字派傳度小道道號三儀。陰陽宅風水（三元派、三合派、八宅、過路陰陽、九宮飛星），大六壬預測，命理八字，面相，法事祈福開運。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>大罗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>刚毕业设计研究生</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小罗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>刚毕业设计研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>暂无</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a>-为什么要在端午节避五毒？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a>-端午送福利！！福袋里面装的是什么？福袋里的金光咒有什么作用？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a>-端午忌酸建议吃点苦～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">13:02</a>-端午驱虫驱邪小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>欢迎大家添加小助理微信进听友群交流～</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl_JLHiwzTs2SEg7SvVRVv39iqz2.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>洛仃洋 - Summer Tenderness</span></p><span></span><p><span>Alastair Gavin - Together Again</span></p><span></span><p><span>麦振鸿 - 猜灯谜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期制作】小罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文案编辑】大罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【商务合作】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:971785860@qq.com"><span>971785860@qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
